Phaemos ESP32 Primary Node - Proteus ISIS Schematic Placeholder

This file is a placeholder. The actual Proteus schematic (.pdsprj)
will be created in Phase 2/3 using Proteus ISIS.

Components to place in Phase 2:
- ESP32 DevKit V1 module
- BME280 breakout (I2C 0x76, SDA=GPIO21, SCL=GPIO22)
- MPU6050 breakout (I2C 0x68, SDA=GPIO21, SCL=GPIO22)
- INA219 breakout (I2C 0x40)
- MLX90614 breakout (I2C 0x5A)
- VL53L0X breakout (I2C 0x29)
- MQ-2 gas sensor module
- AS5600 encoder breakout (I2C 0x36)
- DS18B20 temperature probe (OneWire GPIO4)
- LDR + 10k voltage divider (GPIO33)
- FC-28 moisture sensor module (GPIO36)
- SSD1306 OLED 0.96" (I2C 0x3C)
- WS2812B RGB LED strip (GPIO26)
- Passive buzzer (GPIO25)
- 4-channel relay module (GPIO13, 12, 14, 27)
- LM2596 buck converter (12V to 5V)
- AMS1117 regulator (5V to 3.3V)
- 100nF decoupling caps per IC, 10uF on rails
- 1N5819 Schottky diodes on relay coil outputs
